{
  "slug": "seasons-orbit",
  "kind": "lesson",
  "title": {
    "zh": "地球公转与四季",
    "en": "Earth’s Orbit & the Seasons"
  },
  "desc": {
    "zh": "夏天不是因为地球离太阳近，而是因为地轴斜着——绕太阳一圈，南北半球轮流把「脸」朝向太阳，昼夜长短也跟着轮流占上风。",
    "en": "Summer is not because Earth is closer to the Sun, but because its axis is tilted: around the orbit the hemispheres take turns facing the Sun, and day length swings with them."
  },
